{#
  BeMart admin Customer edit — EC-CUBE goCustomer (会員登録/編集).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `Customer/edit.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/Customer/edit.twig).

  Customer section, FORM/CRUD page. It extends the admin frame
  (`admin-base.html.twig`), not the storefront `base.html.twig`. The
  markup skeleton + `c-*` / `ec-*` / Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim
  from EC-CUBE; only the dynamic bindings are rebound.

  FORM-PAGE recipe (Ray.WebFormModule — see var/templates/README.md):
  the Customer resource (src/Resource/Page/Admin/Customer.php) exposes an
  AdminCustomerForm as `body['form']`, pre-filled with the persisted
  profile. The inputs render through that real form object:

    {{ form.input('name01')|raw }}      <- real <input> w/ id/attrs/value
    {{ form.error('name01') }}          <- inline Be-domain error, if any

  EC-CUBE renders the same inputs through the Symfony FormView
  (`form_widget(form.name.name01)`); Ray.WebFormModule is BeMart's
  BEAR-idiomatic equivalent. `AdminCustomerForm::init()` ports the field
  names / ids / attributes from EC-CUBE's `CustomerType` (block prefix
  `/admin/customer`).

  VALIDATION AUTHORITY STAYS WITH the Be Framework Becoming chain — the
  form is a field-definition + renderer.

  EDIT MODE only — BeMart's Customer resource always resolves an existing
  customer (`onGet(email)`), so EC-CUBE's `{% if Customer.id %}` edit
  branches are always taken; the new-customer branch is dropped (the
  admin create flow is the separate CreateCustomer resource).

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `canonical-url route, params)` -> deterministic `/{route}?{query}`
     (`BeMartTwigExtension`).
   - `form_widget(form._token)` -> EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget. The
     hidden `_token` input is kept (structure) with an empty value;
     EC-CUBE-runtime only — enumerated as residual.
   - `form_widget(form.status)` (公開状態 select in the conversion area)
     -> EC-CUBE master-data (mtb_customer_status). The Customer body
     carries `customerStatus` as a bare int with no option set; the
     status select is OMITTED. Enumerated as residual.
   - `Customer.CustomerAddresses` (お届け先住所 table) -> the
     AdminCustomerFetched projection does NOT carry the customer's
     address book (out of the Wave 5 admin-detail slice). The address
     card renders the empty-state branch. FLAGGED for enrichment
     follow-up.
   - `{% for Order in pagination %}` (注文履歴 table) -> the body's
     `orders` list. The Wave 5 seed carries an empty order history, so
     the empty-state branch renders. The `pageMaxis` page-count dropdown
     + `@admin/pager.twig` are OMITTED (no server-side paging).
   - `csrf_token_for_anchor()` on the address delete `<a>` -> EC-CUBE
     per-request CSRF widget. OMITTED.
   - `{% form_theme %}` and the `auto_render` entity-extension loop ->
     Symfony form-theme / EC-CUBE entity-extension runtime. Dropped.
#}
{% extends 'admin-base.html.twig' %}

{% set route = 'admin-customer' %}
{% set title = '会員登録' %}
{% set sub_title = '会員管理' %}

{% block javascript %}
    <script src="//yubinbango.github.io/yubinbango/yubinbango.js" charset="UTF-8"></script>
{% endblock javascript %}

{% block main %}
    <form name="customer_form" role="form" id="customer_form" method="post" class="h-adr"
          action="/admin/customer?customerId={{ customerId }}"
          novalidate>
        <span class="p-country-name" style="display:none;">Japan</span>
        <input type="hidden" id="customer__token" name="csrfToken" value="{{ csrfToken|default('') }}">
        <div class="c-contentsArea__cols">
            <div class="c-contentsArea__primaryCol">
                <div class="c-primaryCol">
                    <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-8"><span class="card-title">会員情報</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-4 text-end">
                                    <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#ordererInfo"
                                       aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ordererInfo">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-up fa-lg"></i>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="collapse show ec-cardCollapse" id="ordererInfo">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top"
                                             title="自動的に採番される会員のIDです。">
                                            <span>会員ID</span>
                                            <i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <p>{{ customerId }}</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <span>お名前</span>
                                        <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col">
                                                {{ form.input('name01')|raw }}
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col">
                                                {{ form.input('name02')|raw }}
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col">
                                                {% if form.error('name01') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('name01') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col">
                                                {% if form.error('name02') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('name02') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <span>お名前(カナ)</span>
                                        <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col">
                                                {{ form.input('kana01')|raw }}
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col">
                                                {{ form.input('kana02')|raw }}
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col">
                                                {% if form.error('kana01') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('kana01') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col">
                                                {% if form.error('kana02') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('kana02') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <span>会社名</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        {{ form.input('company_name')|raw }}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3"><span>住所</span><span
                                                class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <div class="mb-3">
                                            <div class="row justify-content-start">
                                                <div class="col-auto pe-0 align-self-center"><span>〒</span></div>
                                                <div class="col-2">
                                                    {{ form.input('postal_code')|raw }}
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="mb-3">
                                            <div class="row justify-content-start">
                                                <div class="col-auto">
                                                    {{ form.input('pref')|raw }}
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="mb-3">
                                            {{ form.input('addr01')|raw }}
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="mb-3">
                                            {{ form.input('addr02')|raw }}
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <span>メールアドレス</span>
                                        <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        {{ form.input('email')|raw }}
                                        {% if form.error('email') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('email') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <span>電話番号</span>
                                        <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        {{ form.input('phone_number')|raw }}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <span>パスワード</span>
                                        <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        {{ form.input('plain_password_first')|raw }}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <span>パスワード(確認用)</span>
                                        <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        {{ form.input('plain_password_second')|raw }}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <span>性別</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        {{ form.input('sex')|raw }}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <span>職業</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        {{ form.input('job')|raw }}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <span>誕生日</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        {{ form.input('birth')|raw }}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3">
                                        <span>ポイント</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        {{ form.input('point')|raw }}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-8">
                                    <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top"
                                         title="この会員が登録しているお届け先です。この画面から追加することもできます。">
                                    <span class="card-title">
                                        お届け先住所
                                        <i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i>
                                    </span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-4 text-end">
                                    <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#delivery" aria-expanded="false"
                                       aria-controls="delivery">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-up fa-lg"></i>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="collapse show ec-cardCollapse" id="delivery">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <div id="address_box" class="data-empty">
                                    <span>この会員のお届け先がありません</span>
                                </div>

                                <div class="d-block text-center">
                                    <a href="/admin/customer-delivery-edit?customerId={{ customerId }}"
                                       class="btn btn-ec-regular">お届け先住所を追加</a>
                                </div>

                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-8">
                                    <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top"
                                         title="この会員が注文をした履歴が表示されます。">
                                    <span class="card-title">
                                        注文履歴
                                        <i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i>
                                    </span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-4 text-end">
                                    <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#orderHistory" aria-expanded="false"
                                       aria-controls="orderHistory">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-up fa-lg"></i>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="collapse show ec-cardCollapse" id="orderHistory">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <div id="history_box" class="data-empty">
                                <span>
                                    この会員の購入履歴がありません
                                </span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-8">
                                    <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top"
                                         title="店舗用のメモ欄です。フロント側には表示されません。">
                                        <span class="card-title">ショップ用メモ欄</span>
                                        <i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-4 text-end">
                                    <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#shopMemo" aria-expanded="false"
                                       aria-controls="shopMemo">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-up fa-lg"></i>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="collapse show ec-cardCollapse" id="shopMemo">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                {{ form.input('note')|raw }}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="c-conversionArea">
            <div class="c-conversionArea__container">
                <div class="row justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="c-conversionArea__leftBlockItem">
                            <a class="c-baseLink"
                               href="/admin/customer-list">
                                <i class="fa fa-backward" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                <span>会員一覧</span>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div id="ex-conversion-action" class="row align-items-center justify-content-end">
                            <div class="col-auto">
                                <button class="btn btn-ec-conversion px-5"
                                        type="submit">登録</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </form>

    {% if message is defined and message %}
        <p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ message }}</p>
    {% endif %}
{% endblock %}
